: 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'I do, i like to play the piano and sing music.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 50, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'whats so sad?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 50, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'This is what happens when you elect a man like this.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 50, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'why do elected a man ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 50, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'Why is this even a question?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 45, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'doesnt matter, i m a guide'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 50, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': "I don't understand why this is happening."}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 35, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'i like travelling'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 40, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'I like to sing along, but i do play the piano and sing.'}}]}
