xt': 'I am sorry to hear that. I am a programmer and have a lot of clients.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'how much do you earn a year'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'I am a professional musician. I am a programmer and own a studio.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': "that's even better. are you married ?"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'No, I am not married. I am a musician.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'do you like to play piano ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'I do, I play piano and play piano'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'tell me about yourself'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'I am the latest result in artificial intelligence which can reproduce the functions of the human brain with greater speed and accuracy.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5