 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'tell me a secret'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 35, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'well , i guess its not really a secret if you would know me , but i like reading .'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "it's good. tell me about you"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 45, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'well i am a reader . i love reading enders game sitting in my garden . do you have any hobbies ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'i do like to travel through world. what do you like to do'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': '2 cats pete and repeat and my dog bongo . they like sports more than my kids .'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 15, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': "it's so good. i must go. bye"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'i think we have to wait a bit longer ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'why'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 75}, 'text': 'well there is a lot of pressure to push out good fake content . . get is aid that'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'well okay then. ask me something'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 45, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'good advice . how many children do you have ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': "i don't have any children. i am 24"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 45, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'oh , the info says you do . . . lol . are you married ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'i am single, thank god :)'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 50, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'thank god indeed ! i like taking my dog on walks . you too ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'if i would be lucky to have a dog, i could like to take my dogs on walk of course'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 40, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'yea not much luck i cannot swim either lol 😜'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'