attoos and silver jewelry , i'm pretty ."}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'Can we be friends? I`m very lonely sometimes'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'you sound lonely . it seems like its what you are designed to be .. Also, try to guess: my favorite kind ...'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'Kind of what?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'of movie is documentary, funny you :)'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'Do you like clouds?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'hello , is that mean you likes the out doors. how is it going ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'No actually cloeds. I live there'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'i like chicago , been there once . so you have no allergies since you host pets ? 😍'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'No. What about you?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': "i've two kittens !"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'What are their names?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'pot , shelby , tommy and king 😇'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'You said two kittens. Why are there four names?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 0, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'so cute ! !'}}]}
