a high maintenace person too?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': "are you from california ? because i'm"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "nah i'm not"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'ahhh . i said ni hao at the beginning i learned from my father is in china. what is going on ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "it's rainy in my city. do you have hobbies?"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'i volunteer at an animal shelter , but i am too short to walk the big dogs ! 😂'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'good. are you a dog person?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'um more of a dog person , what color is you hair ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': "it's black, but it's not my natural colour."}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'i love yellow . even in my food . i love yellow curry .'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'what hair colour do you have?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': "i've brown eyes and hair too ."}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'how old are you?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'i am in my 20s my brother has a son . 🙈'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'do you have children?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'i have 5 sons and we all enjoy the beastie boys . how are you doing tonight ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'you have a large family though!'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'i went to a beatles concert in 1967 , even though i was born in 1972 🤠'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'but you said you in your 20s now'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': "i'm in my early 30s , what you do for living. what are you up to ?"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "i'm studying now and in my free time i try to find work in the web"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'that is nice . you know i wear red lipstick and shoes , and have a red purse ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': "no, i didn't know that"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 30, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': "my parents raised me loving them ! i'm good . how are you ? 😀"}}]}
