rts do you watch?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 15, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I like to watch sports, especially running.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 15, 'Neutral': 65}, 'text': "That's good. I run every day"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 15, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I have not tried that. I am more of a gym fanatic exercising.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 15, 'Neutral': 70}, 'text': 'I know'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 15, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I am a huge fan of all sports, but i really like cooking.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 15, 'Neutral': 70}, 'text': 'What do you like to cook?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 0, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 15, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I like to cook and eat out. I am a pretty good eater.'}}]}
