 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 65}, 'text': 'i do it 3x a week its relaxing'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'Yeah. Do you have any hobbies?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': 'i enjoy making friends and exercising , how about you ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I like cars and go to gym as well.'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'huh . that is an interesting combination . say more .'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I work from home.'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'what do you do ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I write books.'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'oh nice , do you write about animals at all ? i like animals'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'I like animals but mostly write about people.'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': 'o yeah , just not a lot about loving things , i do not believe in that. what do you like to do ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': "Me too. i've never had a steady relationship. I like going to gym and swimming."}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'i like wine occassionally but it can bother my stomach . what are you up to tonight ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'Going out with friends. What about you?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': 'nope , reading my favorite book , anne of green gables . how about you ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'Hanging out with friends.'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'do you have any pets ? i have a dog whose name is alfred .'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': "I don't have any pets."}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20,