: 10, 'Joy': 35, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'Ahaha'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 15, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': "I don't understand you 🙈. how is it going today ? 🙈"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'Me too'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 15, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'i like to sing , but only in the shower . scared of what others would think lol'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': 'You are so shy'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'yes i get so uncomfortable. Also, try to guess: i live in ...'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': 'Private house'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 35, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'three storey house, funny you :)'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'Great'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 10, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'what do you do for a living ?'}}, {'role': 'parti