': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'pretty good . my work is in construction but its raining today so just reading .'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'Are you tennis player,no?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 35, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'i am not , but i do love creating art with my mind and hands !'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'Pretty cool'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'well thank you . how do you like the minnesotan winters ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 65}, 'text': 'I don t know'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'that is one of my favorite things to do on weekends ! i have never been to alabama'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 65}, 'text': 'It s time to travel'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 0, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': "that is nice ! i'd love more time for yoga and shopping"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fea